            <ArticleTitle>[Pain in the cardiac area--possibilities of algological diagnosis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>82-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Based on examinations of patients suffering from pains in the heart area, the authors demonstrate possibilities of an algological study in the clinical assessment of the intensity of pain experience. A method of algological testing is described. Correlations established as a result of the study between graphic and verbal estimations of pain experience, &quot;life quality&quot; in patients with different educational levels, sex, and age suggest that the given method may be used to objectively evaluate the pain intensity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
